// The manual tests: every UI test (tests/specs/) written out for a person to
// follow, built into "Manual tests.pdf" by build.mjs (see README.md, "Manual
// tests"). Each is matched to its automated test by spec file and name (the
// test's name under the file's top describe, " › " between levels; * stands
// for the language in tests repeated for each one). The platforms, the
// screenshot and the version it was last valid in come from the automated
// run (capture.mjs), not from here.
//
// When a spec changes, change its case here in the same change: build.mjs
// lists any test without a case, and any case whose test is gone.
//
// The test data (tests/fixtures/communities.json, served by npm run
// manual:serve): Poland has Test Club (Gdańsk, gaming space, a Discord
// invite, "We meet every Thursday.") and Test Person (Warsaw, a member of
// Test Club); France has Test Store (Paris, gaming space). Poland's events:
// Weekend Doubles (7–8 Nov 2026), Test Tournament (5–6 Dec 2026), both hosted
// by Test Club, and Old Cup (1 Oct 2026, past). The automated tests fix the
// date at 10 Nov 2026.

const c = (spec, test, title, steps, expected, setup) => ({ spec, test, title, steps, expected, setup });
const PREPARED = (what) => `Needs prepared server answers (${what}); the automated test sets them up, so on the live site check it when such data is there.`;

